  "brief": "Vantar Post sits ten light-minutes from Rethis and everything orbiting it. A derelict hulk rides Rethis itself; Rethis Shard, a small moon, carries the only rail in range. Every order you send takes ten minutes to arrive, and everything you see already happened ten minutes ago -- plan the launch, commit it, and clear the hulk before the window closes.",
